- pairings_by_inv = pairings.each_with_object({}) { |p, h| p.pairing_invitations.each { |pi| h[pi.invitation_id] = p } }
.expected-section.mb-4{ data: { expected_section: true } }
  %h5.mb-1 Check-in
  %p.text-muted.small.mb-3
    Alphabetical attendance list (use browser Find to jump straight to a name). Checked-in rows stay in place so nothing shifts under your cursor.

  .alert.alert-danger.py-2.px-3.small.d-none{ role: 'alert', data: { expected_error: true } }

  - if attendees.empty?
    .pairing-empty-state.text-center.text-muted.small.py-3.px-3 No confirmed RSVPs yet.
  - else
    .expected-list-card
      .expected-table-header.d-none.d-md-grid.pairing-section-header
        %span Attendee
        %span Note
        %span.text-end Actions
      - attendees.each do |invitation|
        = render partial: 'admin/events/expected_row',
                 locals: { event:, invitation:, pairing: pairings_by_inv[invitation.id] }
